"\n"
"Hello %(user_email)s,<br><br>\n"
"\n"
"You have Residual risk tests available within the platform that are pending assessment. <strong>%(app_name)s</strong> for the Evaluation <strong>%(evaluation_ref)s</strong> which will take place during the period from <strong>%(evaluation_date_begin)s</strong> to <strong>%(evaluation_date_end)s</strong>.<br><br>\n"
"\n"
"The evaluation period is %(certification_year)s%(certification_period)s. Please complete the evaluation by %(evaluation_date_end)s.\n"
"\n"
"You can access the platform from <a href=\"%(site_url)s\">this url</a>with your access data to complete them.<br><br>\n"
"\n"
"If you do not remember your password, you can recover it by accessing <a href=\"%(recovery_url)s\">this url</a> and indicating your email address.<br><br>\n"
"\n"
"Thank you."

