"Regardless of whether this questionnaire is completed in accordance with the"
" evaluation period, it is the responsibility of the person responsible for "
"the report to inform the Compliance Committee immediately of any significant"
" circumstance, punctually reportable, of which he/she becomes aware or which"
" materializes before the end of the reporting period."

#: krm/_templates/evaluation_questionnaires/RuEvaluationQuestionnaireComplete.html:226
